# editor, a 323 by 345 dialog (File, Edit, Wrap menus over a text area holding its own source, editor.icn, its argument): a click on the
# line import gui and the word now typed there; a drag over that line and Alt e and c, Edit's Cut; a click on the fourth line and Alt e and
# p, Edit's Paste; Alt e and u, Edit's Undo; the Wrap menu held open and released on its third item, 40 chars; Alt f and q choose File's
# Quit, which disposes the dialog and the program ends by itself (nothing is saved)
